    <string name="privacy_title">Privacy notice</string>
    <string name="privacy_subtitle">Before continuing, please read and accept how Keeply handles your information.</string>
    <string name="privacy_accept">I accept the privacy notice</string>
    <string name="privacy_decline">Decline and exit</string>
    <string name="privacy_close">Close</string>
    <string name="privacy_accepted_on">You accepted on %1$s</string>
    <string name="privacy_body">Last updated: July 2026\n\n1. Who we are\nKeeply is a personal inventory app for tracking household products (medicines, cleaning, kitchen, and more) on your device.\n\n2. Data we process\nKeeply may store locally:\n• Optional profile (name, age, blood type, phone, email, and notes).\n• Inventory (name, category, brand, form, unit, quantities, expiration, barcode, location, notes, and photos).\n• App preferences (notifications, filters, and custom options).\n• Record of acceptance of this notice (date and version).\n\n3. Purpose\nWe use that data only to:\n• Display and manage your inventory.\n• Send local alerts you configure (expiration, stock, etc.).\n• Improve capture (photo, OCR, and barcodes on device).\n\n4. Storage and transfer\nBy default, information is stored on the device. Keeply does not create a cloud account in this version. If backup is enabled in the future (for example Google Drive), you will be informed and additional consent will be requested.\n\n5. System permissions\n• Camera: to photograph products and scan codes.\n• Notifications: only if you enable them in Settings.\nYou can revoke these permissions in Android settings; some features will become unavailable.\n\n6. Retention and deletion\nData remains while you use the app or until you delete it (for example by removing products or uninstalling Keeply).\n\n7. Minors\nIf the app is used by a minor, it must be under the supervision of a responsible adult.\n\n8. Changes to this notice\nIf we update this notice in a material way, we will ask you to accept it again before continuing.\n\n9. Contact\nFor privacy questions related to Keeply, contact the developer through the app listing in the store where you downloaded it.\n\nBy tapping “I accept”, you confirm that you have read and accept this notice.</string>

